  ### memory/facts/fact-2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration-standard-stretched-pml-matching-and-1d-energy.md
  ---
  fact_id: fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:standard-stretched-pml-matching-and-1d-energy
  problem_id: 2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration
  source_project: 2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration
